This product includes software developed by Yayasan Pesantren Cipansor and
contributors (https://github.com/cipansor/crateworks).

The presentation-form tables and the test fixtures were checked against the
arabic-reshaper library by Abdullah Diab and contributors
(https://github.com/mpcabd/python-arabic-reshaper), which is distributed under
the MIT licence. All three of its tables - the default, `ArabicV2` and
`Kurdish` - are carried here and generated from it by
`research/tools/gen_arabic_tables.py`. The presentation forms themselves are
defined by the Unicode standard; this crate is an independent reimplementation
for Rust.

